# Normalize all text files to LF line endings in the repository, regardless
# of core.autocrlf on the checkout machine — matches .editorconfig's
# end_of_line = lf and prevents `pnpm format`/`pnpm lint:fix` (which write LF)
# from showing the whole repo as modified on Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
